   <p class="SCCNormalDoubleSpacing" style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;
margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:27.35pt;text-indent:-27.35pt;line-height:normal">McLaren, John&nbsp;P.&nbsp;S.&nbsp; “Nuisance in Canada”, in Allen&nbsp;M. Linden, ed., <i>Studies In Canadian Tort Law</i>. &nbsp;Toronto:&nbsp; Butterworths, 1968, 320.</p> 
   <p class="SCCNormalDoubleSpacing" style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;
