   <p class="SCCNormalDoubleSpacing" style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;
margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:27.35pt;text-indent:-27.35pt;line-height:normal">Senzilet, Michael William.&nbsp; “Compensation for Injurious Affection Where No Land Is Taken”, unpublished LL.M. thesis, University of Ottawa, 1987.</p> 
   <p class="SCCNormalDoubleSpacing" style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;
